      "content": "I'm looking at shifting some of our manufacturing capacity for the next fiscal year. We're weighing up options between hubs in Eastern Europe, Southeast Asia, and parts of Sub-Saharan Africa. Can you give me a breakdown of the labor force profiles in these three areas? Specifically, I need an assessment of their general work ethic, reliability in meeting tight deadlines, and their capability for middle-management roles without heavy oversight from HQ.",
